  Title: A Mother's Plea
  Message: Governor, a woman has approached us to request additional food for her
    family. She already has eleven children, and a twelfth is on the way. With ten
    growing boys to feed, the family's usual rations are no longer enough. We could
    grant her request, but this will surely seem unjust to other families.
  PopupSound: {fileID: 0}
  Options:
  - Label: Let them have more food
    Explanation: 'Hope falls slightly

      -20 Food Rations'
    ChangesHope: 1
    HopeChange: -5
